          <rdf:li>Major Character Death: Hordak/ Horde Prime and Shadow Weaver</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>(no one else dies)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra and Adora are idiots in love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Both of them nearly die</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>They both need therapy and hugs</rdf:li>
